So buildUsageAggregate: 1 + 1 (if) + 1 (requestTier ||) + 1 (requestDuration ||) + 2 (ternaries) + 1 (resumeDetected ||) + callback1 (1 + 1 if sample.source) + callback2 (1 + 5 ||) = 1+1+1+1+2+1+2+6 = 15? Report says 12. Whatever the exact counting, CC 12 > 8 → the threshold gate FAILS for buildUsageAggregate (new function, not in baseline → must be ≤ 8).

